{"id":"85387e34d690815e","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-game3-subgame-perfect-equilibrium.md","title":"ZFC Game3 Subgame Perfect Equilibrium","display":"df-zfc-game3-subgame-perfect-equilibrium — ZFC Game3 Subgame Perfect Equilibrium","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game3-subgame-perfect-equilibrium","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game3-subgame-perfect-equilibrium"],"display":"df-zfc-game3-subgame-perfect-equilibrium — ZFC Game3 Subgame Perfect Equilibrium","depends_on":["[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-zfc-game3-nash-equilibrium]]","[[58-df-zfc-game3-strategy-profile]]","[[58-df-zfc-game4-perfect-information-game]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game3-subgame-perfect-equilibrium"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game3-subgame-perfect-equilibrium</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game3-subgame-perfect-equilibrium — ZFC Game3 Subgame Perfect Equilibrium"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8ba5a4b6a64820f3\" href=\"?note=8ba5a4b6a64820f3\" title=\"58-df-zfc-game3-nash-equilibrium\">58-df-zfc-game3-nash-equilibrium</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ddf53d1530db82ba\" href=\"?note=ddf53d1530db82ba\" title=\"58-df-zfc-game3-strategy-profile\">58-df-zfc-game3-strategy-profile</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"75b33efb6ea67912\" href=\"?note=75b33efb6ea67912\" title=\"58-df-zfc-game4-perfect-information-game\">58-df-zfc-game4-perfect-information-game</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame3NashEquilibrium}_S\\subseteq V^{6}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame3NashEquilibrium}_S\\subseteq V^{6}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame3StrategyProfile}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame3StrategyProfile}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame3SubgamePerfectEquilibrium}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame3SubgamePerfectEquilibrium}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame4PerfectInformationGame}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame4PerfectInformationGame}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,N,P,u,\\sigma\\in V\">\\(H,N,P,u,\\sigma\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u=\\langle R,\\preccurlyeq_R,\\widehat u\\rangle\">\\(u=\\langle R,\\preccurlyeq_R,\\widehat u\\rangle\\)</span> packages the payoff carrier, its comparison relation, and the family of continuation-game payoff profiles</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_H,D_{h,i},S_{h,i},\\vec S_h,\\sigma_h\\in V\">\\(A_H,D_{h,i},S_{h,i},\\vec S_h,\\sigma_h\\in V\\)</span> are the auxiliary sets defined below</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame4PerfectInformationGame}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame4PerfectInformationGame}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"75b33efb6ea67912\" href=\"?note=75b33efb6ea67912\" title=\"58-df-zfc-game4-perfect-information-game\">58-df-zfc-game4-perfect-information-game</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame3StrategyProfile}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame3StrategyProfile}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ddf53d1530db82ba\" href=\"?note=ddf53d1530db82ba\" title=\"58-df-zfc-game3-strategy-profile\">58-df-zfc-game3-strategy-profile</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame3NashEquilibrium}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame3NashEquilibrium}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8ba5a4b6a64820f3\" href=\"?note=8ba5a4b6a64820f3\" title=\"58-df-zfc-game3-nash-equilibrium\">58-df-zfc-game3-nash-equilibrium</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame3SubgamePerfectEquilibrium}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame3SubgamePerfectEquilibrium}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}subgame\\text{-}action\\text{-}carrier}\\vdash\nA_H\\coloneqq\\bigcup\\{\\operatorname{ran}(t):t\\in H\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}subgame\\text{-}action\\text{-}carrier}\\vdash\nA_H\\coloneqq\\bigcup\\{\\operatorname{ran}(t):t\\in H\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}subgame\\text{-}decision\\text{-}domain}\\vdash\nD_{h,i}\\coloneqq\n\\{t\\in H^\\circ:\n\\operatorname{dom}(h)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\land\nt\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{dom}(h)=h\\land P(t)=i\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}subgame\\text{-}decision\\text{-}domain}\\vdash\nD_{h,i}\\coloneqq\n\\{t\\in H^\\circ:\n\\operatorname{dom}(h)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\land\nt\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{dom}(h)=h\\land P(t)=i\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}subgame\\text{-}strategy\\text{-}set}\\vdash\nS_{h,i}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(D_{h,i}\\times A_H):\n\\forall t\\in D_{h,i}\\;\\exists!a\\in A_H\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle t,a\\rangle\\in s\\land\nt^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle\\in H\\bigr)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}subgame\\text{-}strategy\\text{-}set}\\vdash\nS_{h,i}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(D_{h,i}\\times A_H):\n\\forall t\\in D_{h,i}\\;\\exists!a\\in A_H\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle t,a\\rangle\\in s\\land\nt^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle\\in H\\bigr)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}subgame\\text{-}strategy\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\vec S_h\\coloneqq\\{\\langle i,S_{h,i}\\rangle:i\\in N\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}subgame\\text{-}strategy\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\vec S_h\\coloneqq\\{\\langle i,S_{h,i}\\rangle:i\\in N\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}subgame\\text{-}profile\\text{-}restriction}\\vdash\n\\sigma_h\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle i,\\sigma(i)\\upharpoonright D_{h,i}\\rangle:i\\in N\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}subgame\\text{-}profile\\text{-}restriction}\\vdash\n\\sigma_h\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle i,\\sigma(i)\\upharpoonright D_{h,i}\\rangle:i\\in N\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}subgame\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}equilibrium}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcGame3SubgamePerfectEquilibrium}_S(H,N,P,u,\\sigma)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\mathrm{ZfcGame4PerfectInformationGame}_S(H,N,P)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcGame3StrategyProfile}_S(H,N,P,\\sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\land\\exists R,\\preccurlyeq_R,\\widehat u\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nu=\\langle R,\\preccurlyeq_R,\\widehat u\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\widehat u,H,\\operatorname{ran}(\\widehat u))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{126pt}\\land\\forall h\\in H\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame3NashEquilibrium}_S\n(N,\\vec S_h,\\widehat u(h),R,\\preccurlyeq_R,\\sigma_h)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}subgame\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}equilibrium}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcGame3SubgamePerfectEquilibrium}_S(H,N,P,u,\\sigma)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\mathrm{ZfcGame4PerfectInformationGame}_S(H,N,P)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcGame3StrategyProfile}_S(H,N,P,\\sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\land\\exists R,\\preccurlyeq_R,\\widehat u\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nu=\\langle R,\\preccurlyeq_R,\\widehat u\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\widehat u,H,\\operatorname{ran}(\\widehat u))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{126pt}\\land\\forall h\\in H\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame3NashEquilibrium}_S\n(N,\\vec S_h,\\widehat u(h),R,\\preccurlyeq_R,\\sigma_h)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The five-place interface is retained, but <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> now explicitly packages the payoff carrier, its preorder, and one payoff profile for every continuation game.</li>\n<li>Continuation strategy spaces and the restricted profile are set-coded from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,N,P,\\sigma\">\\(H,N,P,\\sigma\\)</span>; no undeclared game-restriction or market-equilibrium predicate remains.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-game3-nash-equilibrium","status":"resolved","id":"8ba5a4b6a64820f3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-game3-nash-equilibrium]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-game3-strategy-profile","status":"resolved","id":"ddf53d1530db82ba","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-game3-strategy-profile]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-game4-perfect-information-game","status":"resolved","id":"75b33efb6ea67912","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-game4-perfect-information-game]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-game4-perfect-information-game","status":"resolved","id":"75b33efb6ea67912","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcGame4PerfectInformationGame}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[58-df-